<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav Nov '96 copper output detailed.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav Nov '96 copper output detailed.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV NON-FERROUS ORES	NOV	  OCT	  NOV 1995</p>
<p> copper (thousand tonnes)	1,654	1,795	   1,727</p>
<p> lead-zinc				60	   74		62</p>
<p> bauxite				  60	   50		--</p>
<p>NON-FERROUS METAL PRODUCTION</p>
<p> electrolytic copper (tonnes)  8,759     10,128	   5,959</p>
<p> refined lead			1,925	2,490	     595</p>
<p> zinc				  3,435	3,925	   1,428</p>
<p> aluminium ingots		  3,383	3,106	   2,085</p>
<p> refined silver (kilos)	  4,877	5,336	   5,226</p>
<p>-- Gordana Kukic, Belgrade Newsroom +381 11 222 4254</p>
</text>
